        "type": "animal",
        "note": "The mention of 'cetáceos' (cetaceans) in the context of Garcia de Orta's Colloquios is likely a misidentification or OCR error, as 'cetáceos' refers to whales and dolphins, not crustaceans. The dominant theme points to crustaceans.",
