        "description": "Individual who undertakes expeditions to explore Africa.",
        "note": "This is a descriptive category rather than a specific individual. The term 'African explorers' or 'African travellers' in early modern texts often referred to a group of individuals known for their journeys into the interior of Africa. Without specific names, identifying individual modern referents is impossible. The description reflects the general role.",
